  "details": {
   "biography": {
    "value": "<p>The size it was on the cover: about the owlbear's size. Everybody's first party beat a red dragon at level 3, somehow. It never got to grow, so it is a wyrmling. Its breath, however, is the breath the table remembers.</p><p><strong>Tableau.</strong> Rearing over the hoard, wings half open, jaw wide at nothing. It wakes only if a character steps into the gap in front of it, where the fighter with the shield stood.</p>",
